<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION, every
process: <aggregateBy key="24-Hour Day"/> collapses the 24 hours of each day type
(PreAggDAY.sql) before any generator runs, and <outputtimestep value="Year"/>
sums the day types and the months. January and July 2020 (month keys are
0-based), both day types, all 24 hours.
Gasoline passenger car and light commercial truck and the diesel
combination long-haul truck on road types 1 and 4. EVERY on-road process a
county inventory selects: THC, CO and NOx for running exhaust, start exhaust,
extended idle and crankcase running, start and extended idle; Total Energy at
running exhaust (refueling's prerequisite); THC for evaporative permeation,
fuel vapor venting and fuel leaks and for refueling displacement and
spillage; PM10 and PM2.5 brake and tire wear. The county database is
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql (stated startsPerDay
and hotelling tables), shared with scale-county-timeagg-day/-month.]]></description>
